Create a directory called "vf_scratch".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/files".
a text called 'the workspace' is "vf_scratch/files/fil-27-c1".
Create a directory called 'the workspace'.
a number called 'the gate' is 1.
If 'the gate' is 1 then,
  a number called 'the tally sheet' is 0 subtract 27,
  If 'the tally sheet's sign is not -1 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-30: expected -1 got {'the tally sheet's sign}", Exit 95. Print 'the tally sheet's sign,
  a boolean called 'the tally sheet negative guard fired' is false,
  If 'the tally sheet's negative then, Set 'the tally sheet negative guard fired' to true. Print 'the tally sheet negative guard fired',
  If 'the tally sheet negative guard fired' is false then, Print "ASSERT FIL-31: expected 1 got {'the tally sheet negative guard fired'}", Exit 95. Print 'the tally sheet negative guard fired',
  If 'the tally sheet's absolute is not 27 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-31: expected 27 got {'the tally sheet's absolute}", Exit 95. Print 'the tally sheet's absolute,
  If 'the tally sheet's negative is false then, Print "ASSERT FIL-27: expected 1 got {'the tally sheet's negative}", Exit 95. Print 'the tally sheet's negative,
  If 'the tally sheet's zero then, Print "ASSERT FIL-28: expected 0 got {'the tally sheet's zero}", Exit 95. Print 'the tally sheet's zero.
