If 'the envelope negative guard fired' then, Print "ASSERT FIL-31: expected 0 got {'the envelope negative guard fired'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope negative guard fired'.
If 'the envelope's absolute is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT FIL-31: expected 0 got {'the envelope's absolute}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope's absolute.
